@senate_weak_run_aftermath
title: A bilateral pact, challenged from the Left

KO and Third Way keep one agreed nominee in every district they have divided.
Lewica files its own candidates beside them. We recover a platform for rents,
wages and public services, but we do not dissolve their pact by refusing it.

Every close count will now carry the same accusation: if PiS wins with less
than the combined democratic vote, our candidacy will be blamed. The only clean
answer is to win somewhere ourselves.

- @poland_event_queue: Print the separate ballots

