= August 2023 — The circle does not become a list

<span class="party party-freedomites">**Wolnościowcy**</span> leave February
with three MPs and reach the election with three different plans. **Dobromir
Sośnierz** leaves the party and returns to <span class="party
party-konf">**Konfederacja**</span>. Chair **Artur Dziambor** accepts a place
on the <span class="party party-third-way">**Third Way**</span> ballot while
remaining a Wolnościowcy member. **Jakub Kulesza** decides not to stand.

The party files no independent list. Two MPs keep its parliamentary name until
the term ends; neither returns to the Sejm, and the registered shell dissolves
the following March.

- @poland_event_queue: File the three separate outcomes

