Consular workers, labour inspectors and migration lawyers write one published
route for work, study and family entry, with staffing and audit duties beside
the eligibility rules. Applicants gain a system they can understand; corrupt
brokers lose the scarcity on which they traded.

PiS says we are answering corruption with more migration. We answer that a
state which knows who it admits is stronger than one which sells the stamp.

- @poland_event_queue: Send the consular alternative to the events desk

@visa_auction
title: Accuse PiS of importing the people it tells voters to fear
subtitle: Turn the government's hypocrisy into the attack; migrants already living here will pay for the premise we repeat.
