The line travels immediately: PiS frightened the country with migration while
its own officials opened a paid side door. Our social-patriotic current finally
has an attack which reaches voters outside the Left.

It reaches immigrant neighbours as well. Konfederacja need only remove the
word *corruption* and repeat the rest; progressives and Razem hear us validate
the fear before disputing who profited from it.

