= 15 October 2023 — The Sejm is elected

Polls close after a record mobilisation. We are waiting to learn who returns
to the Sejm, which of our internal currents can still claim a caucus, and
whether any democratic cabinet can govern without our votes. After the count,
the outgoing cabinet remains in place until the first sitting and the
President's nominee begin the constitutional contest for confidence.

- @election_night

