= December 2023 — The hinge is left behind

KO and Lewica hold **[+ formation_coalition_seats +] seats** and need no
toleration. Poland 2050 and PSL receive neither ministries nor a confidence
protocol. The whole Third Way — not one discarded wing of it — is opposition.

Hołownia and Kosiniak-Kamysz respond by keeping their common organisation
together. They accuse KO of using the democratic camp as a campaign slogan and
Lewica of using it only until the count produced a smaller cabinet. Exclusion
therefore strengthens their reason to remain a distinct centre instead of
starting either party's old solo-collapse story.

- @third_way_excluded_channel
