Local correspondents, union media and the parliamentary studio begin sharing
one distribution system. It is smaller than TVP and cannot be dismissed by a
minister because the party now owns the equipment and subscriber list.

PiS keeps public broadcasting. We stop treating access to it as our media
strategy and accept the cost of becoming a publisher as well as a party.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the new network on the events desk

