= November's march, December's government

Bartosz Malewski, president of the Independence March Association, has again
brought nationalists through Warsaw behind a claim to own the national
holiday. Legal observers return with reports from the route; minority residents
and shopkeepers remember which flags passed their doors.

The file reaches us while parties are still bargaining over the cabinet. [? if
civic_independence_years > 0: Our earlier civic commemorations mean we already
have speakers, veterans and local organisers able to offer another patriotic
tradition.?] [? if independence_monitor_years > 0: Our monitoring operations
have also built lawyers and witnesses who can make misconduct harder to erase.?]
[? if independence_join_years > 0: A social-patriotic current has marched
inside Malewski's event before and wants that foothold recognised.?]

Lewica can build a civic institution, enter the nationalist stage, keep only
the legal record, or decide that formation matters more. The march will not
wait for us to finish negotiating ministries.

- @ind23_civic
- @ind23_join
- @ind23_monitor
- @ind23_ignore

@ind23_civic
title: Establish a permanent democratic-independence committee
subtitle: [? if civic_independence_investment >= 3: The committee and its partners now cover the annual operation. No resource cost.?][? if civic_independence_investment < 3: Cost: 1 resource.?] Give mayors, unions and democratic veterans a tradition of their own.
choose-if: civic_independence_investment >= 3 or resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Formation has consumed the organisers.
on-arrival: resources -= 1 if civic_independence_investment < 3; civic_independence_investment += 1 if civic_independence_investment < 3; independence_march_strategy = "Civic tradition"; civic_independence_years += 1; civic_patriotism += 5; local_network += 2; public_trust += 2; far_right_street_capacity -= 1; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 10; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_backlash += 4; news_headline = "A civic independence tradition survives the transfer of power"

Mayors, trade unionists and democratic veterans agree to meet every year under
their own programme rather than as a hurried counter-demonstration. Local
organisers leave with a date, a committee and permission to speak about Poland
without first answering the radical right.

Malewski keeps his march. He loses the quieter monopoly in which every other
party treated patriotism as a problem to manage for one afternoon.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the civic committee on the events desk

@ind23_join
title: Let the social-patriotic current enter the main march
subtitle: It gains an autonomous national platform while coalition partners demand distance.
on-arrival: independence_march_strategy = "Join the Independence March"; independence_join_years += 1; civic_patriotism += 4; social_patriot_support += 9; left_cultural_position += 4; left_right_score += 4; rural_support += 2; progressives_dissent += 8; spring_dissent += 6; razem_dissent += 5; ko_relation -= 2; p2050_relation -= 2; minority_safety -= 2; far_right_street_capacity += 2; far_right_fragmentation += 2; public_mood_pending_national_security_support += 5; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support -= 4; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_backlash += 5; news_headline = "Lewica's social patriots join the march as coalition partners keep their distance"

The social-patriotic current enters under its own red-and-white banner and
speaks about wages, sovereignty and public ownership to a crowd Lewica usually
abandons. Rural organisers see courage where liberal partners see laundering.

KO and Polska 2050 keep their candidates away. Progressive members and
minority groups now hold the party responsible for every chant and symbol near
our column, whether we controlled it or not.

- @poland_event_queue: Return the party column to the events desk

@ind23_monitor
title: Fund monitors, legal aid and victim reporting
subtitle: Protect participants and preserve evidence without contesting the nationalist ownership of the ceremony.
on-arrival: independence_march_strategy = "Legal monitoring"; independence_monitor_years += 1; police_trust += 2; minority_safety += 4; government_procedural_restraint += 2; far_right_agenda -= 1; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 8; public_mood_pending_national_security_salience += 3; news_headline = "The annual march receives a permanent legal record"

Lawyers open a hotline, observers mark police orders and medics record injuries
before the clips detach them from the route. Victims receive names to call and
future prosecutors receive something stronger than rival recollections.

The operation protects people without giving them another Independence Day
story. Malewski still owns the flags and speeches; we own the evidence when
his event crosses the law.

- @poland_event_queue: File the monitoring record on the events desk

@ind23_ignore
title: Spend the transition capital elsewhere
subtitle: Keep organisers and political attention in cabinet formation; concede the holiday's largest public stage to the radical right.
on-arrival: independence_march_strategy = "Ignore the march"; independence_ignored_years += 1; far_right_street_capacity += 4; civic_patriotism -= 2; konf_poll_momentum += 0.2; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support -= 3; public_mood_pending_national_security_salience += 3; news_headline = "The radical right keeps the Independence Day stage"

The legal team stays with formation and the party sends no rival event, column
or permanent monitoring operation. Negotiators gain another week; local
activists learn which work headquarters regards as expendable.

The march is remembered through its organisers' cameras. Konfederacja and the
street right do not need to defeat a democratic patriotic tradition because
none arrives to compete.

- @poland_event_queue: Close the march file and return to the events desk

@republika_advertisers
# prose-audit: Grade A — Sakiewicz, Holecka, advertisers and displaced viewers anchor the private-media shift, with retained consequences for restraint, state pressure and institutional investment.
title: Advertisers flee TV Republika
subtitle: Commercial pressure can shrink revenue and enlarge grievance
