@eu_network
title: Turn the accumulated European network into a Polish social-security campaign
subtitle: Requires three European channels and 42 influence. Bring unions, Ukraine allies and parliamentary contacts home as one recognisably Left compact.
choose-if: eu_campaign_progress >= 3 and eu_influence >= 42
