on-arrival: eu_campaign_complete = 1; eu_campaign_stage = "Polish EU settlement — funds, democratic law and social investment"; eu_influence += 8; eu_left_network += 5; eu_progressive_headwind -= 4; ukraine_solidarity += 4; labor_credibility += 4; military_trust += 2; left_poll_momentum += 0.5; party_unity += 2; far_right_agenda -= 2; news_headline = "Years of European work produce a distinct Polish Left campaign"

Trade union contacts, democratic-law allies and Ukrainian partners come
to Warsaw under one compact. It ties social security to a state able to defend
both its border and its courts, instead of asking voters to choose between the
two.

The campaign exists only because earlier missions built people willing to sign
it. Konfederacja cannot dismiss the result as another Brussels slogan; the
Left has brought a network home and given it Polish obligations.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the Warsaw compact on the events desk

@eu_right
title: Harden the migration line before Konfederacja owns it
subtitle: Follow the issue which rewarded Mentzen's party; sacrifice refugee and minority trust without guaranteeing any voters follow us back.
on-arrival: border_security_confidence += 4; refugee_empathy -= 5; minority_safety -= 4; far_right_agenda += 6; konf_poll_momentum += 0.4; democratic_rightward_pressure += 5; eu_progressive_headwind += 3; eu_influence -= 3; eu_left_network -= 3; news_headline = "The governing parties chase a radical-right frame"

Our spokespeople move from wages and institutions to the claim that the
coalition must be harder on migration than Konfederacja expects. The change
reassures voters who read the European count principally as a border warning.

Mentzen welcomes the concession and asks why they should buy the copy. Refugee
and minority organisations hear their security traded for an electorate that
may still prefer the original.

- @poland_event_queue: Return the rightward turn to the events desk

@abortion_defeat
# prose-audit: Grade B — Six branches correctly cover passage and defeat, but the payoff of the chapter's strongest arc opens on a raw tally and two conditional lines. Neither Kotula nor Lempart is in the chamber, no deputy is seen crossing or refusing, and each response gets one short paragraph where abortion_first_reading gave two. The result beat is thinner than the setup that earned it.
title: The decriminalisation roll call
subtitle: The result follows seats, relations and the April strategy
face-image: img/poland/events/womens-strike-2020.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 28
order: 10
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2024 and month = 7 and government_party != "pis" and caretaker_government = 0 and abortion_reform_settled = 0
on-arrival: {!
const leftVotes =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_seats) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_splinter_support_votes) || 0);
let pslShare =
    0.12 + Math.max(0, Number(Q.psl_relation) || 0) / 180;
if (Q.abortion_strategy == "Free vote with constituency pressure") {
    pslShare += 0.12;
}
if (Q.abortion_strategy == "Decriminalisation sequence") {
    pslShare += 0.08;
}
pslShare = Math.max(0.08, Math.min(0.72, pslShare));
const roll =
    Math.floor((this.random.uint32() / 4294967296) * 9) - 4;
Q.abortion_vote_left = leftVotes;
Q.abortion_vote_ko = Math.round(
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0) * 0.86
);
Q.abortion_vote_p2050 = Math.round(
    (
        Math.max(0, Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0) +
        Math.max(0, Number(Q.centrum_seats) || 0)
    ) * 0.68
);
Q.abortion_vote_psl = Math.round(
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0) * pslShare
);
Q.abortion_vote_yes = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        460,
        leftVotes + Q.abortion_vote_ko +
        Q.abortion_vote_p2050 + Q.abortion_vote_psl + roll
    )
);
Q.abortion_vote_no = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        460 - Q.abortion_vote_yes,
        Math.round(
            (Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0) +
            (Number(Q.konf_seats) || 0) +
            (Number(Q.korona_seats) || 0) +
            Math.max(
                0,
                (Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0) -
                Q.abortion_vote_psl
            ) +
            Math.max(
                0,
                (Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0) -
                Q.abortion_vote_ko
            )
        )
    )
);
Q.abortion_vote_abstain = Math.max(
    0,
    460 - Q.abortion_vote_yes - Q.abortion_vote_no
);
Q.abortion_vote_passed =
    Q.abortion_vote_yes > Q.abortion_vote_no ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.abortion_vote_passed) {
    Q.feminist_trust += 6;
    Q.psl_coalition_dissent += 3;
    Q.government_coalition_dissent += 2;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Decriminalisation passes " + Q.abortion_vote_yes +
        "–" + Q.abortion_vote_no;
} else {
    Q.feminist_trust -= 5;
    Q.psl_coalition_dissent += 8;
    Q.government_coalition_dissent += 8;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Decriminalisation fails " + Q.abortion_vote_yes +
        "–" + Q.abortion_vote_no;
}
!}

