The cabinet brings rescue coordination and compensation approval into one
national chain. Households receive a simple promise and local officials lose
the ability to move money around a ministry queue.

Initial payments produce visible command. So do the first files trapped at the
centre, and the fiscal commitment arrives before every damaged building has
been counted. We have chosen ownership broad enough that no later delay belongs
to somebody else.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the central command decision on the events desk

