Our researchers begin keeping two calendars: Jaki's rallies and judicial
campaigns on one, Morawiecki's economic conferences and cautious European
signals on the other. Journalists gain a map of the quarrel hidden beneath the
same logo, and future votes may expose it. The price is suspicion among our own
supporters that we are scouting partners inside a party whose record we once
treated as indivisible.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the faction map on the events desk

