**[+ ko_primary_2024_surname +]** receives Lewica's congratulations together
with a written list on collective bargaining, housing and reproductive rights.
KO's social-liberal supporters use the negotiation to pull the campaign away
from a simple rerun of anti-PiS unity. The defeated currents accept the primary
result, while warning that KO has allowed a smaller party to price its
endorsement.

We have not endorsed the candidate. We have made future cooperation easier
and left a document against which both parties can be judged.

- @poland_event_queue: Put the negotiated compact on the events desk

@ko_primary_intervene
