The Palace holds supreme command in peacetime through the defence minister,
and that is the door we use. A short joint statement names who exercises
operational command until a successor is appointed, and commits both offices
to the appointment inside a stated period.

Voters barely register it. The eastern-flank allies who spent the weekend
asking questions do, and so does every officer who wanted to know whether the
political class could still produce one sentence together about the army.

- @poland_event_queue: Publish the continuity statement

